# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/scanner

## Purpose
Integrates network scanning and diagnostic capabilities into the Android application surface.

## Contents
Contains Android-facing scan models, coordinators, and adapters that invoke or present scanner behavior.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Consumed by Android UI/service flows and depends on networking/scanner contracts plus Android lifecycle and permission facilities when applicable.

## Invariants
Scan cancellation and lifecycle termination must propagate, partial diagnostics must not be reported as complete success, and network work must respect Android permission/state constraints.